	(lib_symbols)
	(text_box "DESIGN NOTES - TEST DEBUG\n\nLOGIC ANALYSER HEADER for Kingst LA5016: 2x10 2.54 mm, 16 signals + 4 GND. Pin order TBC to match LA5016 cable.\nEach signal via 0R/100R series resistor at the header (short stub, can be cut).\nCH0 I2C SCL | CH1 I2C SDA | CH2 GPS PPS | CH3 GPS TX->P4 | CH4 m1421 TX | CH5 m1421 RX (after mux) | CH6 m1421 SYNC | CH7 m1421 DIO26\nCH8 P4 UART0 TX | CH9 C5 UART0 TX | CH10 User UART TX | CH11 P4->GPS TX | CH12 PM ALERT | CH13 CHG INT/PD ALERT | CH14 P4 DBG_A | CH15 P4 DBG_B\nTEST POINTS: every power rail (VBUS_USER, VBAT, VSYS, 5V, 5V_SDR, 5V_LCD, all 3V3 branches, P4 core rails, 3V3_DEV), GND test points near each, Kelvin pads on all PAC1954 shunts."
